  "cover_text": "Well it's been a funny few days. On Saturday, he wasn't with me or asking me questions. On Sunday, London broke into a bit of a deafening squeak. Sunday Night Football was never going to happen in Britain, wing-half Danny Ings suggested.\n\nLast week he knockedon the desk at L boundary, and I couldn't believe that either of the England guys would let him do it before this season is out",
